{"title": "IndiGo Launches 'Lite' Fare for Lighter Travelers", "summary": "IndiGo has introduced a new fare structure called 'Lite' that allows passengers to pay only for their cabin baggage, effective July 15. The fare will be available on both domestic and international flights, starting from July 1, and can be booked through the airline's app or website.", "summary_points": ["IndiGo has launched a new fare structure called 'Lite' that focuses on lighter travelers", "The 'Lite' fare is applicable to both domestic and international flights", "Passengers will only pay for their cabin baggage under this new fare", "The fare can be booked through the airline's app or website starting July 1", "Travel becomes eligible effective July 15"], "title_hi": "इंडिगो लाइट फेयर", "summary_hi": "इंडिगो ने एक नया फेयर संरचना 'लाइट' शुरू किया है जिसमें यात्रियों को केवल उनकी केबिन बैग पर भुगतान करना पड़ेगा, जो 15 जुलाई से लागू होगा। यह फेयर दोनों घरेलू और अंतरराष्ट्रीय उड़ानों के लिए लागू होगा, जिसकी पुस्तकी 1 जुलाई से शुरू होगी।", "summary_points_hi": ["इंडिगो ने एक नया फेयर संरचना 'लाइट' शुरू किया है जिसमें हल्के यात्रियों पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया गया है", "इस 'लाइट' फेयर की लागूता दोनों घरेलू और अंतरराष्ट्रीय उड़ानों में होगी", "यात्रियों को केवल उनकी केबिन बैग पर भुगतान करना पड़ेगा इस नए फेयर में", "इस फेयर की पुस्तकी 1 जुलाई से शुरू होगी और यात्रा 15 जुलाई से लागू होगी", "यात्रियों को अपनी उड़ान की पुस्तकी में बदलाव करना पड़ेगा"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage focuses on the practical implications of the 'Lite' fare, explaining how it will work and who can benefit from it. They also mention that this new fare structure is part of IndiGo's efforts to reduce costs.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets frame the launch of the 'Lite' fare as a move by the airline to cut costs and increase profits. They suggest that this could lead to higher ticket prices for passengers who need checked baggage."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्रीय समाचार एजेंसियां इस 'लाइट' फेयर को लागू करन